+++ b/features/todos.feature
@@ -0,0 +1,167 @@
+Feature: Todo management
+  As a user
+  I want to manage a list of todos
+  So that I can keep track of tasks
+
+  Background:
+    Given the app is loaded
+
+  Rule: New todos
+
+  Scenario: Create a new todo by pressing Enter
+    Given the todo input is focused
+    When the user types "Buy milk" and presses Enter
+    Then the todo list shows 1 item
+    And the new todo has the title "Buy milk"
+    And the todo input is cleared
+
+  Scenario: Trimming whitespace from new todo input
+    Given the todo input is focused
+    When the user types "   Buy milk   " and presses Enter
+    Then the todo list shows 1 item
+    And the new todo has the title "Buy milk"
+
+  Scenario: Ignoring empty or whitespace-only todo input
+    Given the todo input is focused
+    When the user types "   " and presses Enter
+    Then the todo list is empty
+
+  Rule: No todos state
+
+  Scenario: Main section is hidden when there are no todos
+    Given the todo list is empty
+    Then the main section is hidden
+
+  Scenario: Footer is hidden when there are no todos
+    Given the todo list is empty
+    Then the footer is hidden
+
+  Scenario: Main and footer are visible when there are todos
+    Given the todo list has 1 item
+    Then the main section is visible
+    And the footer is visible
+
+  Rule: Completing todos
+
+  Scenario: Mark a todo as completed
+    Given the todo list has 1 item "Buy milk"
+    When the user clicks the toggle on "Buy milk"
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" has the completed class
+    And its checkbox is checked
+
+  Scenario: Mark a completed todo as active
+    Given the todo list has 1 completed item "Buy milk"
+    When the user clicks the toggle on "Buy milk"
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" does not have the completed class
+    And its checkbox is not checked
+
+  Rule: Mark all as complete
+
+  Scenario: Toggle all todos as complete
+    Given the todo list has items "Buy milk", "Walk dog", "Write code"
+    When the user clicks the toggle-all checkbox
+    Then all todos are marked as completed
+
+  Scenario: Toggle all todos back to active
+    Given all todos are completed
+    When the user clicks the toggle-all checkbox
+    Then all todos are marked as active
+
+  Scenario: Toggle-all checkbox reflects individual completions
+    Given the todo list has items "Buy milk", "Walk dog"
+    When the user completes "Buy milk"
+    And the user completes "Walk dog"
+    Then the toggle-all checkbox is checked
+
+  Rule: Deleting todos
+
+  Scenario: Delete a todo using the destroy button
+    Given the todo list has 1 item "Buy milk"
+    When the user clicks the destroy button on "Buy milk"
+    Then the todo list is empty
+
+  Rule: Editing todos
+
+  Scenario: Enter editing mode by double-clicking the label
+    Given the todo list has 1 item "Buy milk"
+    When the user double-clicks the label of "Buy milk"
+    Then the editing input is shown for "Buy milk"
+    And the editing input contains "Buy milk"
+
+  Scenario: Save edit on Enter
+    Given the todo "Buy milk" is being edited
+    When the user types "Buy organic milk" in the edit field and presses Enter
+    Then the todo title is "Buy organic milk"
+    And the editing mode is closed
+
+  Scenario: Save edit on blur
+    Given the todo "Buy milk" is being edited
+    When the edit field loses focus
+    Then the todo title is the edited value
+    And the editing mode is closed
+
+  Scenario: Destroy todo when edit is empty
+    Given the todo "Buy milk" is being edited
+    When the user clears the edit field and presses Enter
+    Then the todo list is empty
+
+  Scenario: Destroy todo when edit is whitespace only
+    Given the todo "Buy milk" is being edited
+    When the user types "   " in the edit field and presses Enter
+    Then the todo list is empty
+
+  Scenario: Cancel editing with Escape
+    Given the todo "Buy milk" is being edited with new text "Buy eggs"
+    When the user presses Escape
+    Then the todo title is "Buy milk"
+    And the editing mode is closed
+
+  Rule: Todo counter
+
+  Scenario: Display count of active todos (plural)
+    Given the todo list has items "Buy milk", "Walk dog", "Write code"
+    When 1 item is completed
+    Then the todo count shows "2 items left"
+
+  Scenario: Display count of active todos (singular)
+    Given the todo list has 1 item "Buy milk"
+    Then the todo count shows "1 item left"
+
+  Scenario: Display count when no active todos
+    Given the todo list has 1 completed item "Buy milk"
+    Then the todo count shows "0 items left"
+
+  Rule: Clear completed
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed removes all completed todos
+    Given the todo list has items "Buy milk", "Walk dog", "Write code"
+    When 2 items are completed
+    And the user clicks "Clear completed"
+    Then the todo list shows 1 item
+    And that item is "Write code"
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed button is hidden when no items are completed
+    Given the todo list has 1 active item "Buy milk"
+    Then the clear-completed button is hidden
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed button is visible when items are completed
+    Given the todo list has 1 completed item "Buy milk"
+    Then the clear-completed button is visible
+
+  Rule: Persistence
+
+  Scenario: Todos persist across page reload
+    Given the todo list has items "Buy milk", "Walk dog"
+    When the page is reloaded
+    Then the todo list shows 2 items
+    And the first todo has the title "Buy milk"
+    And the second todo has the title "Walk dog"
+
+  Scenario: Completed state persists across page reload
+    Given the todo list has 1 completed item "Buy milk"
+    When the page is reloaded
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" has the completed class
+
+  Scenario: localStorage key follows the naming convention
+    Given the todo list has 1 item "Buy milk"
+    Then the localStorage key "todos-vanilla" exists
